          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The datasets provided by the SKILLNET project have been curated (i.e., cleaned, harmonized, reconciled) using manual and semi-automatic methods. Even though a lot of dedication and effort was put in curating the datasets provided here, some errors, inaccuracies and/or missing data still exist.\n<br>\nUntil December 2022 the dataset will be constantly updated with more cleaned data. For that reason, it is important that users of the dataset always include the version number in their reports."
