    "files": [
      {
        "description": "This file contains letter metadata from the original paper inventory of Antonio Magliabechi's letters by Manuela Doni Garfagnini, which was OCR-ed, parsed, cleaned and mapped to the person names in the CEN  dataset curated during the SKILLNET project. \n\nIt is a .csv file with comma as separator, with 20575 rows, where each row represents the metadata of one letter in Garfagnini's inventory.\n\nBecause the letters are almost in its entirety received by Antonio Magliabechi, we don't provide a separate \"person names\" file, but the column \"SKpersonId_sender\" contains the corresponding mapped Id (skp) to the CEN dataset when they were equivalent. The other names have a unique Id starting with \"gap\" (garfagnini person).",
